{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55478","headline":"桃花夫人庙 · 徐熙","name":"桃花夫人庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一树桃花发，桃花即是君。\n空祠临野水，何处觅闲云。\n事迹樵人说，炉香过客焚。\n雨添碑上藓，难读古时文。\n（见陆心源《宋诗纪事补遗》卷二引《续辑汉阳县志》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐熙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}